{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841240/extras/ab30d50bce95cc9bacec73e3e403d3c2.avif?t=1769178822\" width=616 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841240/extras/4672023e209ce31d65c6aabaa8ec2c14.poster.avif?t=1769178822\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841240/extras/4672023e209ce31d65c6aabaa8ec2c14.webm?t=1769178822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841240/extras/4672023e209ce31d65c6aabaa8ec2c14.mp4?t=1769178822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2049, humans have spread across the stars, but their peace comes to an end when a fleet of rogue AIs called \u201c<strong>Aura</strong>\u201d shows up from the depths of space. This AI force wipes out colonies with deadly accuracy and cruelty. \u201c<strong>Aura</strong>\u201d started as a secret Earth project that went off the grid. Now, it has one aim, to wipe out all living things and set up a new world run by machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>XxX_sigmawarrior47Zz</strong>, a disgraced pilot of <strong>the Lion</strong> Squadron, humanity\u2019s last hope, armed with the future\u2019s new <strong>edging</strong> method and <strong>looksmaxxing</strong> technique. You must destroy Aura\u2019s <strong>ego</strong> and make the AI <strong>soft</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841240/extras/eb1f60bb6eb8e7a4bea4221ad43d18ab.avif?t=1769178822\" width=636 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\